---
import ContentPage from '../components/ContentPage.astro';
import { APP_NAME, LEGAL_EFFECTIVE_DATE, PRIVACY_EMAIL, PUBLISHER } from '../data/site';
---
<ContentPage
  pageTitle={`Privacy Policy · ${APP_NAME}`}
  description={`What ${APP_NAME} collects, why, and what you can do about it.`}
  eyebrow="Legal"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
>
  <p><strong>Effective date: {LEGAL_EFFECTIVE_DATE}</strong></p>
  <p>
    {APP_NAME} ("Tracer", "the app") is published by {PUBLISHER} ("we", "us"). This page explains what the app
    collects, why, and the choices you have.
  </p>

  <h2>The short version</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You don't create an account or give us your name to use the app.</li>
    <li>Your videos and projects stay on your phone. Videos you trace with the app may be used to improve our algorithms.</li>
    <li>We collect basic app usage and crash information to keep the app working and make it better.</li>
    <li><strong>We do not sell your data, we do not show ads, and we do not track you</strong> across other companies' apps or websites.</li>
    <li>You can ask us to delete your data at any time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Videos you trace</strong>, which may be used to improve our algorithms.</li>
    <li><strong>App usage</strong>: which features you use, and general location (country or city) based on your connection.</li>
    <li><strong>Crash and error reports</strong>, so we can fix problems.</li>
    <li><strong>Purchases</strong>: your subscription status, so you can use and restore it.</li>
    <li><strong>Messages you send us</strong> through the feedback form, with the name and email you give.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This information is linked to an anonymous ID the app creates, not to your name.</p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>
    Only with service providers that run parts of the app for us, such as hosting, analytics, crash reporting and
    subscriptions, and only for those purposes. Apple handles all payments.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>As long as we need it to run and improve the app, or until you ask us to delete it.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Delete your account in the app's Settings to remove the data linked to it.</li>
    <li>Email <a href={`mailto:${PRIVACY_EMAIL}`}>{PRIVACY_EMAIL}</a> to see, correct or delete your data, or to object to how we use it. We reply within 30 days.</li>
    <li>Deleting your account doesn't cancel a subscription: manage that in your Apple ID settings.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The app is not meant for children under 13. If you think a child has used it, email us and we will delete their data.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We post changes on this page and update the date above. If a change matters for how we use your data, we tell you in the app first.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>{PUBLISHER} · <a href={`mailto:${PRIVACY_EMAIL}`}>{PRIVACY_EMAIL}</a></p>
</ContentPage>
